                <widget class="QLabel" name="report_2_label">
                 <property name="text">
                  <string>The selected events by sleep stage, sleep cycle, and thirds and halves of the night, kept by the criteria of the report. Predefined reports: arousals, bruxism, periodic limb movements (PLM: sleep only, recording time, awake in the sleep period, before sleep onset), respiratory events, snoring, and events without criteria (sleep only, EOG_Phasic, EOG_Tonic).</string>
                 </property>
                 <property name="wordWrap">
                  <bool>true</bool>
